    "title": "Kick-Off Times Explained: How to Read a Fixture List in Your Own Timezone",
    "description": "Why fixture lists disagree about kick-off times, what BST and CET actually mean, and the two weeks each year when the usual time difference between Europe and North America is simply wrong.",
    "category": "guides",
