    "title": "Why the Same Match Is on a Different Channel in Every Country",
    "description": "There is no global channel for any competition. Broadcast rights are sold territory by territory, in packages, on staggered cycles — which is why the answer to 'where can I watch this' changes at every border.",
    "category": "guides",
    "publishedAt": "2026-08-16",
    "readTime": 6,
