    "title": "TNT Sports SD Has Ended on Sky: Where TNT Sports Is Available Now",
    "description": "Sky switched off standard-definition TNT Sports on 1 July 2026, so older Sky+ boxes no longer receive it. Here is every place TNT Sports is carried in the UK, and what it shows.",
    "category": "guides",
